{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4035612","formula":"C₂₅H₁₅NO₉","hill":"C25H15NO9","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":25.0,"H":15.0,"N":1.0,"O":9.0},"names":{"en":"6-carboxyfluorescein succinimidyl ester","ru":"CFSE"},"descriptions":{"en":"Carboxyfluorescein succinimidyl ester (CFSE) is a fluorescent cell staining dye. CFSE is cell permeable and covalently couples, via its succinimidyl group, to intracellular molecules, notably, to intracellular lysine residues and other amine sources. Due to this covalent coupling reaction, fluorescent CFSE can be retained within cells for extremely long periods.","ru":"СFSE (Carboxyfluorescein succinimidyl ester) — вещество, известное также под названием CFDA-SE (carboxyfluorescein diacetate succinimidyl ester), представляет собой интернализуемую флуоресцентную метку, способную пассивно проникать внутрь клетки. Само по себе это вещество бесцветно и не флуоресцирует до тех пор пока его ацетильные группы не будут расщеплены внутриклеточными эстеразами. После контакта с эстеразами CFSE превращается в сильнофлуоресцирующее вещество."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":2762614,"mass":473.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CC(=O)N(C1=O)OC(=O)C2=CC3=C(C=C2)C(=O)OC34C5=C(C=C(C=C5)O)OC6=C4C=CC(=C6)O","inchikey":"VDABVNMGKGUPEY-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"(2,5-dioxopyrrolidin-1-yl) 3',6'-dihydroxy-1-oxospiro[2-benzofuran-3,9'-xanthene]-5-carboxylate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"2762614","atoms":50,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.955,"y":0.229,"z":1.804,"el":"O"},{"x":2.435,"y":0.157,"z":-2.238,"el":"O"},{"x":2.813,"y":0.213,"z":4.114,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.096,"y":0.116,"z":-0.093,"el":"O"},{"x":2.313,"y":4.884,"z":-2.435,"el":"O"},{"x":3.484,"y":-4.454,"z":-2.42,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.868,"y":-1.141,"z":1.677,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.33,"y":1.878,"z"